	(label "RLD_OUT"
		(at 317.5 50.8 270)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71074cb0-b5c7-4b62-a556-018f19f2fea7")
	)
	(label "AGND"
		(at 355.6 50.8 270)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5b34f72-4634-4501-aa1b-6101c99cae1f")
	)
	(text "POWER: USB-C 5V (D101) / LiPo (Q101) auto power path -> VSYS -> U6 LP5907 3.0 V -> +3V0_A (ADS1298 AVDD)\nand U9 AP2112K 3.3 V -> +3V3 (ESP32-S3, ADS1298 DVDD). U6 EN = +3V3, so the AFE is off whenever the MCU rail is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d54da28-c5e6-43dd-aaac-b69c67fc527b")
	)
	(text "ELECTRODES: J1 TRS for CH1 (T +, R -, S REF).\nJ6 1 mm FPC carries CH1-CH3 for a flex array or breakout,\nin parallel with J1 for CH1: use one or the other.\nAll REF pins share RLD_ELEC. J6 1/5/9 + MP = AGND guards."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55 214 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e08130be-8f1c-49c2-8e0d-8bad9d8cd4cf")
	)
	(text "INPUT RC: 22k series (limits fault and plug-insertion current) + 100pF C0G to AGND, ~72 kHz.\nKept small so high-impedance dry electrodes do not turn mains common-mode into differential hum.\nADS1298 oversamples at 512 kHz, so this is the only anti-alias filter needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 70 120 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f59cb95f-abb7-4710-a7b9-6a2f33b345b3")
	)
	(text "ADS1298: CH1-CH3 used, CH4-CH8 and TESTP tied to AVDD per datasheet (power down in firmware).\n1, 2 or 3 channels by mode, no rework. HPF/LPF in firmware: capture ~0.5 Hz up at 4 kSPS+.\nLead-off detection and RLD channel selection are firmware settings.\nInternal clock (CLKSEL high), internal 2.4 V reference."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "42cdf078-0f72-4e5f-b548-598d6d39a356")
	)
	(text "RLD: 1M || 1.5nF feedback, 330k series to the REF electrode(s) limits DC fault current to <10 uA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240 108 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35eb321a-256b-4cdb-97e3-04484b2c1c96")
	)
	(text "SAFETY: with electrodes on the body and USB-C plugged in, run the laptop on battery,\nunplugged from mains, or use a simulated input. Charge while worn only from\nan isolated (Class II) charger.\nLAYOUT: keep U1 and its supply away from the XIAO antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cfefb8db-d679-4c2a-aebf-4b7f31e95b25")
	)
	(text "LiPo: J3 = two solder pads for a protected LiPo. U8 MCP73831 charges it from USB at 100 mA (R_PROG 10k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "01cd50d5-0c04-4e0e-ba1f-83531caaf7f3")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262 42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e0467164-a0a8-4e3d-8d2b-d39461e9a583")
	)
