	(text "MCU: ESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8 (PCB antenna, keep copper out of the antenna end). Native USB on IO19/IO20 through USBLC6 ESD to USB-C.\nADS1298 SPI: IO12 SCLK, IO13 DOUT (MISO), IO14 DIN (MOSI), IO15 CS, IO16 DRDY, IO17 START, IO18 RESET.\nFlashing over USB uses the built-in USB-Serial-JTAG. If it ever stops enumerating: short TP10 (IO0) to GND, then tap TP9 (EN) to GND.\nCharger U8 MCP73831 at 100 mA (R703 10k). 3.3 V rail U9 AP2112K from VSYS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 290 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
