	(text "ON/OFF: SW1 disconnects the battery from the system path (Q101). Off = 0 uA from the cell; USB still powers the board and U8 still charges the cell.\nSlider toward pin 1 = ON (connects 2-1). BATTERY MONITOR: VBAT_SYS / 2 into IO10 (ADC1_CH9), 1M/1M + 100nF, 2 uA only while ON.\nCHARGE LED: D102 lit while U8 is charging (STAT low); off when full or no USB."
